{"aliases":[],"ancestry":{"derived_from":[],"mutation_dimensions":["identification_cost","identification_methods","risk_of_use","curse_mechanics"],"observed_in":["cross-game design analysis"],"source_games":["broguece","cataclysm-bn","crawl","nethack"]},"concept_type":"design_primitive","concrete_examples":[{"description":"In NetHack, items such as potions and scrolls are initially identified as 'unknown' when picked up, requiring players to use them to discover their effects. This adds a layer of risk, as a potion could be beneficial or harmful, prompting players to weigh the potential consequences before using an unidentified item.","game":"nethack","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7e5b-a659-dc0465421413","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1075-7dbf-a51b-c713e9c26615","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-787f-a72b-53ecd0e67e57","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7316-97a8-fb33968a55b8","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7a18-8a2f-a0684b6dd106","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-77be-843d-023b929be9dd","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7bac-b269-41b82a62a658","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-71d0-97c3-a2ceb6107f64","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7b6a-99c6-85f213529fdf","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7ff5-afc2-a68c3bd836c0"],"source_file":""},{"description":"In broguece, unidentified items are represented with a question mark, and players must use a specific resource, such as identification scrolls or a skill, to reveal their properties. This mechanic introduces a strategic layer as players must decide when to use limited resources to identify items, weighing the potential benefits against the risks of using unknown items.","game":"broguece","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-026c-7e6b-a036-cc9dd7a859a5","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-025c-75eb-b046-a0b5cd3e87bb","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-023c-789f-bd54-277b32f37159","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-028a-7100-8af6-9a3e238ca420","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-024c-7412-862b-36d68113563a","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-027a-7936-99c7-68edf2b50bc9","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-06a6-73c4-bcac-c0970a8b1ab7","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-06fe-7858-9371-82d74a3a6fe5","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-0696-73fd-b04c-7b80a542e6d4","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-0675-7969-a039-2a57a21f89ac"],"source_file":""},{"description":"In 'Crawl', players encounter unidentified items that can include weapons, armor, and potions. To learn their properties, players must either use them (which carries the risk of negative effects) or use a limited resource like scrolls of identify, creating strategic decisions around resource management and risk assessment.","game":"crawl","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a72-74a4-8962-8d61a1317e1b","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7745-b3c2-b24ff2995f17","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7bf4-84f7-ae3813bb6241","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7aaa-80b1-2cd349ffd2c2","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7c8e-b1bc-720ff47def0c","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7a40-ab6e-9d85e37def5c","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7fad-9b7d-19d73db8446d","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7987-aa24-664adba3c28b","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7498-9e41-1cedcf8e37a4","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a73-7265-b422-f981fd55aeef","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a18-7027-916a-36937993f4ab","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a55-70d7-8bf4-2c7223db1054","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a1f-757e-99f8-863048ab1cc4","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a41-7236-87e7-93a1ef930633","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a2a-7c96-b614-625330bfcf68","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a20-7222-b116-31c0df5053c3","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a50-7907-aa0e-f6ff7e39c59f","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a45-7381-8377-bb8942737a60","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a1b-7f3e-a023-931c23f1d34a","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3a3a-7888-bc96-c811ebf2b696"],"source_file":""},{"description":"In cataclysm-bn, items are initially unidentified and players must use resources like identification scrolls or spend time to reveal their properties. This creates a risk-reward scenario where players must decide whether to use an unknown item, potentially facing negative effects.","game":"cataclysm-bn","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-93e6-7d76-8a62-0c00d958261e","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-936f-77e3-b9b7-31cebfa4ca49","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9369-7018-87e4-535b2cb62e88","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-936a-705d-9b02-00ef9b639ffe","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9369-77e0-b136-47ce32a0f19f","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9369-7bbf-87e3-bb3cdef54543","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9369-70d0-b620-12cd1a9db111","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9383-7b9e-a88b-2c039449eb33","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-936c-77c8-97e2-06fc99a53412","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-949d-7f37-8c07-6213e7e3e2d0"],"source_file":""}],"decision_refs":[],"definition":"A game mechanic where items must be identified before their properties are known. This creates information asymmetry and risk — using an unknown item may be beneficial or harmful. Identification consumes resources or creates gameplay decisions.","epistemic":{"confidence":"inferred","status":"observed"},"evidence_refs":[],"exclusion_criteria":["Items with always-visible properties","Identification that is free and instantaneous","Items that are purely cosmetic without hidden properties"],"id":"urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a03267-890e-7c11-b854-8ddd0952c24b","implementation_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7